test-corpus/public/contextures/

# On-demand real-world fidelity corpus: only the manifest + downloader are committed; the
# downloaded/local workbooks and generated run outputs are never committed.
fidelity-corpus/files/
fidelity-corpus/runs/

# On-demand real-world DOCX fidelity corpus for FreeW. Only the manifest + downloader
# are committed; downloaded/local documents and generated run outputs stay private.
freew-fidelity-corpus/files/
freew-fidelity-corpus/runs/

